OL,3,GNEWSAGillian Anderson felt 'betrayed'
OL,4,Aby The Salt Path allegations after
OL,5,Aappearing in adaptation
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Salt Path star Gillian Anderson has
OL,8,Fsaid allegations that the memoir was
OL,9,Ffabricated felt like "a betrayal" after
OL,10,Fspending time with the couple.
OL,12,FAnderson played Raynor Winn in the film
OL,13,Fadaptation of the 2018 memoir, which
OL,14,Fwas released in the UK last year.
OL,16,FIt tells the story of how Winn and her
OL,17,Fhusband Moth, who was diagnosed with a
OL,18,Fneurological condition, walked the
OL,19,FSouth West Coast Path after losing
OL,20,Ftheir Welsh home.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
