OL,3,GNEWSAGillian Anderson felt 'betrayed'
OL,4,Aby The Salt Path allegations after
OL,5,Aappearing in adaptation
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut an investigation by the Observer
OL,8,Fsuggested some of Winn's claims about
OL,9,Fthe events that had led to the couple
OL,10,Flosing their home had been
OL,11,Fmisrepresented.
